  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/Canallasyprincesas2public.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(19 fotos) Este domingo, a partir de la 18 horas, se presentar&aacute; en el Teatro M&oacute;naco de Onda la segunda sesi&oacute;n del musical</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/Canallasyprincesas1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>&#39;Canallas y princesas&#39;, con canciones de Joaqu&iacute;n Sabina y dirigido por el ondense Christian Mart&iacute;nez Ll&aacute;cer.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6497.jpg\" alt=\"img_6497\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6500.jpg\" alt=\"img_6500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6502.jpg\" alt=\"img_6502\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6503.jpg\" alt=\"img_6503\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6512.jpg\" alt=\"img_6512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6519.jpg\" alt=\"img_6519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6521.jpg\" alt=\"img_6521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/musicalsabinateatremonaco/img_6523.jpg\" alt=\"img_6523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;